| fresh author + hot readback | `.../20260905_10_render_support_execute_v5/render_buffer_support_builder_report.json` | 45,145 | `68294b545c41ff2efd957dfb4d81cbcd61e141bd7bd601a53d83467fb223f426` | PASS |
| cold editor readback | `.../20260905_11_render_support_cold/render_buffer_support_builder_report.json` | 28,490 | `8b5d4961c3324c2cb012611706b5e02e37182e4a913ba3fd82667ee47f10209f` | PASS |
