최종 target identity:

| target file | bytes | SHA-256 |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| `M_CFNL_RenderBufferSaver.uasset` | 14,758 | `b902dadd6378aeec601febe5fe8e312fbe3a70e627780134650a7e693d880b18` |
